    "unknownFlag": "exit 1, help on stdout and `Unrecognized flag: --x in command …` on stderr",
    "notYargs": "1.x used yargs; 2.x uses effect/cli, so the 1.x grammar flags (booleanEquals, deferUtilityOptions) were re-derived here, not copied"
  },
